('1980 Nepal Himalayan GLOF Events','1980-nepal-himalayan-glof-events',(SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug='glof'),'1980-01-01','1980','Nepal Himalaya','Historical inventories identify destructive glacial lake outburst flood activity in the Nepal Himalaya around the early 1980s.','GLOFs can release water, ice and sediment with very little warning. Early event inventories are sometimes inconsistent in dates and names, so this grouped record avoids attributing uncertain details to a specific lake without a technical source.','Event totals vary by inventory','Event totals vary by inventory','Glacial lake outburst flood','River channels, settlements, trails and infrastructure can be damaged downstream.','ICIMOD GLOF inventory; Nepal government technical reports',0,'PUBLISHED'),
